# P25 Round-8 theorem — the unit roof cannot be transferred to the physical clock

Date: **2026-08-28**

## Material Passport

- Origin skill: `ars-codex:academic-research-suite`
- Workflow position: ARS Stage 1 research, Route-A ownership audit
